  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ugolinus de Ugurgieri dat Guidotto de Saracinis servum nomine Petrum filium Iohannis cum uxore et filiis, et accipit in commutatione servum nomine Martinum fabrum ferrarium cum familia sua, utraque parte consentiente et laudante.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis ex partibus hanc commutationem rescindere temptaverit, poenam dupli valoris rerum commutatarum persolvat et carta ista in suo robore permaneat.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness>
          <name>Salimbene de Tolomeis</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Forteguerrius filius Petri</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Ubertinus de Berardenga</name>
        </witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
